      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - VIP membership is a weekly/monthly/annual subscription. You will get a 3-day FREE trial period. After that, will be charged {0} per week/month/year.
      - VIP会员为周/月/年订阅服务。您将享受一个3天的免费试用，在此之后，您将被收取 {0} 每周/月/年。
