    - Term: mg_rule_1
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - Daily first 5 times use <strkey=fusion_wishlist_btn/> of <strkey=troop_fusion/>, probability of <strkey=troop/> selected from <strkey=fusion_wishlist_btn/> increase from 15% to <color=#2EA800>20%</color>
      - 每日前5次使用<strkey=troop_fusion/>的<strkey=fusion_wishlist_btn/>，<strkey=fusion_wishlist_btn/>选择的<strkey=troop/>出现概率由15%提升至<color=#2EA800>20%</color>
      - 每日前5次使用<strkey=troop_fusion/>的<strkey=fusion_wishlist_btn/>，<strkey=fusion_wishlist_btn/>選擇的<strkey=troop/>出現機率由15%提升至<color=#2EA800>20%</color>
      - Ежедневно первые 5 раз используйте <strkey=fusion_wishlist_btn/> из <strkey=troop_fusion/>, вероятность использования <strkey=troop/>, выбранного из <strkey=fusion_wishlist_btn/>, увеличивается с 15% до <color=#2EA800>20%</color>
      - Die ersten fünf täglichen Nutzungen von <strkey=fusion_wishlist_btn/> von <strkey=troop_fusion/> erhöhen die Wahrscheinlichkeit, dass <strkey=troop/> aus <strkey=fusion_wishlist_btn/> ausgewählt wird, von 15% auf <color=#2EA800>20%</color>
      - Les 5 premières fois par jour, utilisez <strkey=fusion_wishlist_btn/> de <strkey=troop_fusion/>, la probabilité de <strkey=troop/> sélectionné parmi <strkey=fusion_wishlist_btn/> augmente de 15% à <color=#2EA800>20%</color>
      - Las primeras 5 veces diarias use <strkey=fusion_wishlist_btn/> de <strkey=troop_fusion/>, la probabilidad de <strkey=troop/> seleccionado de <strkey=fusion_wishlist_btn/> aumenta del 15% al <color=#2EA800>20%</color>
      - As primeiras 5 vezes diárias usam <strkey=fusion_wishlist_btn/> de <strkey=troop_fusion/>, a probabilidade de <strkey=troop/> selecionado de <strkey=fusion_wishlist_btn/> aumenta de 15% para <color=#2EA800>20%</color>
      - 매일 처음 5번은 <strkey=troop_fusion/> 중 <strkey=fusion_wishlist_btn/>을 사용하고, <strkey=fusion_wishlist_btn/>에서 선택한 <strkey=troop/> 확률은 15%에서 <color=#2EA800>20%</color>
      - 毎日最初の 5 回は <strkey=troop_fusion/> の <strkey=fusion_wishlist_btn/> を使用し、<strkey=fusion_wishlist_btn/> から選択される <strkey=troop/> の確率が 15% から <color=#2EA800>20%</color>
      - Le prime 5 volte giornaliere utilizzano <strkey=fusion_wishlist_btn/> di <strkey=troop_fusion/>, la probabilità di <strkey=troop/> selezionata da <strkey=fusion_wishlist_btn/> aumenta dal 15% al ​​<color=#2EA800>20%</color>
      - Günlük ilk 5 kez <strkey=troop_fusion/>Smelting'e<strkey=fusion_wishlist_btn/> kullanın, <strkey=fusion_wishlist_btn/> arasından seçilen <strkey=troop/> olasılığı %15'ten <color=#2EA800>%20</color>
      - Щоденні перші 5 разів використовують <strkey=fusion_wishlist_btn/> злиття <strkey=troop_fusion/>, ймовірність <strkey=troop/> вибраного з <strkey=fusion_wishlist_btn/> збільшується з 15% до <color=#2EA800>20%</color>
      Flags: 00000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: mg_rule_2
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - '<strkey=lucky_draw/> gain Lucky bonus <color=#2EA800>+50%</color>, up to 400 extra <strkey=lucky_bonus/> per day (the same privileges can be stacked)'
      - '<strkey=lucky_draw/>获得<strkey=lucky_bonus/><color=#2EA800>+50%</color>，每日最多额外获得400点<strkey=lucky_bonus/>（相同特权可叠加）'
      - '<strkey=lucky_draw/>取得<strkey=lucky_bonus/><color=#2EA800>+50%</color>，每日最多額外獲得400點<strkey=lucky_bonus/>（相同特權可疊加）'
      - '<strkey=lucky_draw/> получите бонус удачи <color=#2EA800>+50%</color>, до 400 дополнительных <strkey=lucky_bonus/> в день (те же привилегии можно суммировать)'
      - '<strkey=lucky_draw/> erhalten Sie einen Glücksbonus <color=#2EA800>+50 %</color>, bis zu 400 zusätzliche <strkey=lucky_bonus/> pro Tag (die gleichen Privilegien können gestapelt werden)'
      - '<strkey=lucky_draw/> gagnez un bonus Chance <color=#2EA800>+50 %</color>, jusqu''à 400 <strkey=lucky_bonus/> supplémentaires par jour (les mêmes privilèges peuvent être cumulés)'
      - '<strkey=lucky_draw/> gana bonificación de suerte <color=#2EA800>+50 %</color>, hasta 400 <strkey=lucky_bonus/> adicionales por día (se pueden acumular los mismos privilegios)'
      - '<strkey=lucky_draw/> ganhe bônus de sorte <color=#2EA800>+50%</color>, até 400 <strkey=lucky_bonus/> extras por dia (os mesmos privilégios podem ser acumulados)'
      - '<strkey=lucky_draw/> 행운 보너스 <color=#2EA800>+50%</color> 획득, 하루 최대 400 추가 <strkey=lucky_bonus/> (동일한 특권은 중첩 가능)'
      - '<strkey=lucky_draw/> ラッキー ボーナス <color=#2EA800>+50%</color> を獲得、1 日あたり最大 400 追加 <strkey=lucky_bonus/> (同じ特典は重複可能)'
