      Languages:
      - Colossus <color=#dd6300><link="bubble://troops_status_7">[Taunt]</link></color> all enemies within range and reduces their attack strength.
      - 石像兵对范围内所有敌人施加<color=#dd6300><link="bubble://troops_status_7">【嘲讽】</link></color>状态，并降低他们的攻击力。
