    - Term: skill_desc_114
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - Charge other Light Tower to boost their attack power. Overflow damage will be spread evenly to enemies within a certain range.
      - 为其他【光塔】充能，提升攻击力。溢出伤害会平摊到一定范围内的敌人。
