      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - Dullahan will execute enemies whose hit point is lower than <color=#ec0202>{0}</color>. And restore <color=#ec0202>{1}</color> HP.
      - 杜拉汉会处决生命值低于<color=#ec0202>{0}</color>的敌人。并回复<color=#ec0202>{1}</color>生命值。
      - 杜拉漢會處決生命值低於<color=#ec0202>{0}</color>的敵人。並回复<color=#ec0202>{1}</color>生命值。
