      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - Odin deals <color=#ec0202>{0}</color> damage and increases the damage taken by the enemy by <color=#ec0202>{1}</color>, then deals <color=#ec0202>{2}</color> damage.
      - 奥丁造成<color=#ec0202>{0}</color>伤害，并使敌人受到的伤害增加<color=#ec0202>{1}</color>，然后造成<color=#ec0202>{2}</color>伤害。
