      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: factor_desc_12
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - Attacking units will take {0}% more damage each time they kill a defending unit.
      - 每次击杀敌人时，进攻方单位会多受到 {0}% 的伤害。
      - 每次擊殺敵人時，進攻方單位會多受到 {0}% 的傷害。
