      - '{skill_name}''s area is increased by {skill=X:P}, casting range by {skill=CastRange:P}, and damage by {skill=LastDmg:P}.'
      - '{skill_name}范围增大{skill=X:P}，施法距离增加{skill=CastRange:P}，伤害增加{skill=LastDmg:P}。'
      - '{skill_name}範圍增大{skill=X:P}，施法距離增加{skill=CastRange:P}，傷害增加{skill=LastDmg:P}。'
