      - '{skill_name}''s cooldown is reduced to {skill=Cd} seconds, and it will fire simultaneously.'
      - '{skill_name}冷却时间缩短至{skill=Cd}秒，并且会同时开炮。'
      - '{skill_name}冷卻時間縮短至{skill=Cd}秒，並且會同時開砲。'
